@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083/api/v1/orders
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Create Order
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "shippingAddress": "123 Main Street, New York, NY 10001",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Get Order by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{createOrder.response.body.id}}

### Get Orders by User
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/{{userId}}?page=0&size=10

### Update Order Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{createOrder.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

### Create Order - No Items (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "shippingAddress": "123 Main St",
  "items": []
}
